{
    "name": "§9Huell Babineaux",
    "entityType": "easy_npc:humanoid",
    "description": "Saul's personal bodyguard and pickpocket.",
    "skin": {
        "type": "URL_SKIN",
        "skinUrl": "https://s.namemc.com/i/11b1d86c5f0307fa.png"
    },
    "attributes": {
        "maxHealth": 40,
        "invulnerable": false,
        "attackableByPlayers": true,
        "attackableByMonsters": true,
        "nameVisibility": "NEVER"
    },
    "dialogs": {
        "main": {
            "greeting": "（站在原地，身体庞大）我在听。如果是关于索尔的事，他现在可能在忙着。如果是关于你的安全，我也可以提供……保护。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "§6§l接受任务",
                    "action": "OPEN_QUEST_DIALOG:RANDOM_POOL:c33a3288-a84b-4bb2-80bb-414d262fb5a7,62e17938-1596-4372-a7c4-937b9e78f0c3,ea93a1d1-3536-477b-9308-a6d6c25d16c5,33c91bb0-b642-482c-808e-d43266d1c4dd,fed7e708-7777-4ea4-b674-346927afe1bf,5d1eba26-c066-4995-ac85-52db99da0176",
                    "id": "btn_quest_1bd49a12"
                },
                {
                    "label": "你以前是做什么的？",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:story_1",
                    "id": "btn_story"
                },
                {
                    "label": "我需要有人帮我‘保管’点东西。",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:quest_intro",
                    "id": "btn_quest"
                }
            ]
        },
        "story_1": {
            "greeting": "以前？我在路易斯安那州，那是我第二次进监狱的时候。我在那里的地位很高。直到索尔救了我，或者说是雇佣了我。他说我需要换个环境，所以我来了新墨西哥州。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "索尔救了你？怎么回事？",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:story_2",
                    "id": "btn_ask"
                },
                {
                    "label": "回到主菜单",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:main",
                    "id": "btn_back"
                }
            ]
        },
        "story_2": {
            "greeting": "我不能透露客户的具体细节。但索尔是个好人。他给了我一份体面的工作。虽然现在我不能像以前那样……随心所欲了。但我这身肉也不是白长的。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "听起来你很感激他。",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_close"
                },
                {
                    "label": "回到主菜单",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:main",
                    "id": "btn_back"
                }
            ]
        },
        "quest_intro": {
            "greeting": "‘保管’东西？行啊。只要你付得起价钱。把东西给我，或者把那个人指给我看。我的口袋很深，而且通常很安全。除非是像沃尔特·怀特那样的情况，那谁也没办法。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "这是定金，事成之后还有更多。",
                    "action": "START_QUEST:Slippin_Huell",
                    "id": "btn_accept"
                },
                {
                    "label": "我得先确认你的能力。",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:main",
                    "id": "btn_decline"
                }
            ]
        }
    },
    "pose": "STANDING",
    "drop": {
        "item": {
            "item": "numismatic-overhaul:bronze_coin,numismatic-overhaul:silver_coin",
            "count": 15
        },
        "minCount": 15,
        "maxCount": 30,
        "chance": 0.5,
        "playerKillOnly": true
    },
    "objectives": {
        "attackHostileMobs": true,
        "attackPlayers": false,
        "wanderRange": 50.0,
        "returnToSpawn": false
    }
}